<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="city-grid" data-stagger><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/manchester-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/manchester-mills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/manchester-mills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/manchester-mills.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Manchester</b><small>Hillsborough County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/nashua-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/nashua-city-hall.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/nashua-city-hall-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/nashua-city-hall.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Nashua</b><small>Hillsborough County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/concord-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/concord-state-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/concord-state-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/concord-state-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Concord</b><small>Merrimack County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/portsmouth-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/portsmouth-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/portsmouth-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/portsmouth-aerial.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Portsmouth</b><small>Rockingham County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/dover-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-mill.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-mill-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-mill.webp 1018w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1018" height="679" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Dover</b><small>Strafford County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/rochester-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/porch-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/porch-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/porch-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Rochester</b><small>Strafford County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/derry-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/colonial-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/colonial-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/colonial-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Derry</b><small>Rockingham County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/salem-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/victorian-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/victorian-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/victorian-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Salem</b><small>Rockingham County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/keene-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-trees-snow-road.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-trees-snow-road-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-trees-snow-road.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Keene</b><small>Cheshire County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/laconia-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laconia-mills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laconia-mills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laconia-mills.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Laconia</b><small>Belknap County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/lebanon-hanover-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hanover-webster-hall.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hanover-webster-hall-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hanover-webster-hall.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>Lebanon &amp; Hanover</b><small>Grafton County</small></span></a><a class="cc rv" href="/new-hampshire-cities/north-conway-nh/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/conway-covered-bridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/conway-covered-bridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/conway-covered-bridge.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="cc-b"><b>North Conway</b><small>Carroll County</small></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims change from region to region</h2><p>The same policy wording plays out differently in a Portsmouth colonial, a Laconia camp and a North Conway ski condo.</p></div><div class="row-list" data-stagger><div class="row-card static rv"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hampton-dunes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hampton-dunes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hampton-dunes.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>Portsmouth · Dover · Hampton</small><h3>Seacoast</h3><p>Eighteen miles of coastline, the Piscataqua River and Great Bay. Older homes in Portsmouth’s South End and Exeter meet newer subdivisions inland, and nor’easters test both.</p></span></div><div class="row-card static rv"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/manchester-mills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/manchester-mills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/manchester-mills.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>Manchester · Nashua · Concord</small><h3>Merrimack Valley</h3><p>The state’s population center. Summer storms track across Hillsborough and Merrimack counties, and multi-unit buildings turn one frozen pipe into several claims.</p></span></div><div class="row-card static rv"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wolfeboro-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wolfeboro-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wolfeboro-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>Laconia · Wolfeboro · Meredith</small><h3>Lakes Region</h3><p>Lake Winnipesaukee’s shoreline is lined with seasonal camps that sit empty for months. Freeze-ups found in spring and ice damage to waterfront structures lead the claim list.</p></span></div><div class="row-card static rv"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lebanon-library.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lebanon-library-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lebanon-library.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>Keene · Lebanon · Hanover</small><h3>Monadnock &amp; Upper Valley</h3><p>Brick downtowns, river valleys and college-town rentals. Heavy wet snow and river flooding have both left their mark on Cheshire and Grafton counties.</p></span></div><div class="row-card static rv"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lonesome-lake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lonesome-lake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lonesome-lake.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>North Conway · Lincoln · Berlin</small><h3>White Mountains &amp; North Country</h3><p>Elevation, deep snowpack and steep valleys. Carroll and Coös county claims often involve condominium associations, snow-load framing damage and storm runoff.</p></span></div></div>
<div class="county-box rv"><h2>All 10 counties</h2><ul class="chips"><li>Belknap</li><li>Carroll</li><li>Cheshire</li><li>Coös</li><li>Grafton</li><li>Hillsborough</li><li>Merrimack</li><li>Rockingham</li><li>Strafford</li><li>Sullivan</li></ul></div></div></section>
